icles</h2><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-nautilus-titan">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus vs Nautilus Titan: Which Robotic Pool Cleaner Should You Buy in 2026?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus and Dolphin Nautilus Titan across cleaning performance, smart features, filtration, ease of use, value, and long-term ownership to determine which robotic pool cleaner is the better choice for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-nautilus-titan">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-premier-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Dolphin Premier vs Polaris 9650iQ Sport: Which Premium Robotic Pool Cleaner Is Better in 2026?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Premier and Polaris 9650iQ Sport across cleaning performance, filtration, navigation, wall climbing, ease of use, and long-term value to determine which premium robotic pool cleaner is right for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-premier-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-titan-vs-dolphin-premier">Dolphin Nautilus Titan vs Dolphin Premier: Which Robotic Pool Cleaner Is Better in 2026?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Nautilus Titan and Dolphin Premier across cleaning performance, filtration, smart features, wall climbing, ease of use, and long-term value to determine which robotic pool cleaner is right for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-titan-vs-dolphin-premier">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-titan-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Dolphin Nautilus Titan vs Polaris 9650iQ Sport: Which Premium Robotic Pool Cleaner Is Better in 2026?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Nautilus Titan and Polaris 9650iQ Sport across cleaning performance, navigation, smart features, filtration, wall climbing, and long-term value to determine which robotic pool cleaner is best for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-titan-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-aiper-scuba-s1">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus vs Aiper Scuba S1: Corded Value vs Cordless Convenience</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus and Aiper Scuba S1 across cleaning performance, corded vs cordless design, filtration, ease of use, and long-term value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-aiper-scuba-s1">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-titan-vs-aiper-scuba-s1">Dolphin Nautilus Titan vs Aiper Scuba S1: Which Smart Pool Cleaner Is Better?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Nautilus Titan and Aiper Scuba S1 across smart features, cordless convenience, cleaning performance, wall climbing, and long-term value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-titan-vs-aiper-scuba-s1">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/polaris-9650iq-sport-vs-aiper-scuba-s1">Polaris 9650iQ Sport vs Aiper Scuba S1: Premium Corded vs Cordless Convenience</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Polaris 9650iQ Sport and Aiper Scuba S1 across navigation, cordless convenience, wall cleaning, debris handling, and long-term value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/polaris-9650iq-sport-vs-aiper-scuba-s1">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-premier-vs-aiper-scuba-s1">Dolphin Premier vs Aiper Scuba S1: Filtration Power or Cordless Convenience?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Premier and Aiper Scuba S1 across debris handling, filtration, cordless convenience, wall cleaning, and value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-premier-vs-aiper-scuba-s1">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-dolphin-sigma">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus vs Dolphin Sigma: Is the Premium Upgrade Worth It?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus and Dolphin Sigma across cleaning performance, smart features, navigation, filtration, and value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-dolphin-sigma">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-sigma-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Dolphin Sigma vs Polaris 9650iQ Sport: Premium Robot Pool Cleaner Showdown</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Sigma and Polaris 9650iQ Sport across navigation, smart features, filtration, wall climbing, and premium value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-sigma-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-premier-vs-dolphin-sigma">Dolphin Premier vs Dolphin Sigma: Which Premium Dolphin Is Better?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Premier and Dolphin Sigma across filtration, navigation, smart features, cleaning performance, and long-term value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-premier-vs-dolphin-sigma">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/aiper-scuba-s1-vs-beatbot-aquasense-2">Aiper Scuba S1 vs Beatbot AquaSense 2: Which Cordless Pool Robot Is Better?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Aiper Scuba S1 and Beatbot AquaSense 2 across cordless convenience, runtime, navigation, wall cleaning, waterline performance, and value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/aiper-scuba-s1-vs-beatbot-aquasense-2">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/aiper-scuba-s1-vs-aiper-seagull-pro">Aiper Scuba S1 vs Aiper Seagull Pro: Which Aiper Pool Cleaner Should You Buy?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Aiper Scuba S1 and Aiper Seagull Pro across cordless design, cleaning performance, wall coverage, ease of use, and value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/aiper-scuba-s1-vs-aiper-seagull-pro">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/hayward-sharkvac-xl-vs-dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus">Hayward SharkVac XL vs Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus: Which Is the Better Value Cleaner?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Hayward SharkVac XL and Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus across cleaning performance, filtration, wall climbing, maintenance, and value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/hayward-sharkvac-xl-vs-dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/hayward-tigershark-qc-vs-dolphin-premier">Hayward TigerShark QC vs Dolphin Premier: Which Robotic Pool Cleaner Is Better?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Hayward TigerShark QC and Dolphin Premier across quick cleaning, filtration, wall climbing, debris handling, and long-term value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/hayward-tigershark-qc-vs-dolphin-premier">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/pentair-prowler-930-vs-dolphin-nautilus-titan">Pentair Prowler 930 vs Dolphin Nautilus Titan: Which Smart Robotic Cleaner Is Better?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Pentair Prowler 930 and Dolphin Nautilus Titan across smart features, cleaning performance, wall climbing, filtration, and value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/pentair-prowler-930-vs-dolphin-nautilus-titan">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/polaris-f9550-sport-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Polaris F9550 Sport vs Polaris 9650iQ Sport: Which Polaris Robot Should You Buy?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Polaris F9550 Sport and Polaris 9650iQ Sport across cleaning performance, app control, navigation, waterline cleaning, and value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/polaris-f9550-sport-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/beatbot-aquasense-2-vs-dolphin-nautilus-titan">Beatbot AquaSense 2 vs Dolphin Nautilus Titan: Cordless Premium vs Corded Smart Cleaning</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Beatbot AquaSense 2 and Dolphin Nautilus Titan across cordless convenience, smart features, wall cleaning, runtime, and value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/beatbot-aquasense-2-vs-dolphin-nautilus-titan">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-sigma-vs-beatbot-aquasense-2">Dolphin Sigma vs Beatbot AquaSense 2: Premium Corded vs Premium Cordless</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-06-03</p><p>Compare the Dolphin Sigma and Beatbot AquaSense 2 across premium cleaning performance, cordless convenience, smart features, wall cleaning, and value.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-sigma-vs-beatbot-aquasense-2">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/robotic-pool-cleaner-weight-why-it-matters">Robotic Pool Cleaner Weight: Why It Matters More Than Most Buyers Realize</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Robotic pool cleaner weight affects cleaning performance, wall climbing, ease of removal, and long-term ownership. Learn how weight impacts real-world use and how to choose the right balance for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/robotic-pool-cleaner-weight-why-it-matters">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners">Corded vs Cordless Robotic Pool Cleaners: Which Is Right for Your Pool?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Corded and cordless robotic pool cleaners offer very different ownership experiences. Learn how power, runtime, convenience, and pool size affect which option is best for you.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/how-to-choose-the-right-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-your-pool">How to Choose the Right Robotic Pool Cleaner for Your Pool</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Choosing the right robotic pool cleaner depends on pool size, surface type, debris, and convenience preferences. This guide explains what actually matters and how to avoid common buying mistakes.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/how-to-choose-the-right-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-your-pool">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-dolphin-premier">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus vs Dolphin Premier: Which One Is Worth It?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>The Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus and Dolphin Premier are two of the most popular robotic pool cleaners on the market. Compare cleaning performance, filtration, wall climbing, maintenance, and value to determine which model is best for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-dolphin-premier">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners-for-large-pools">Corded vs Cordless Robotic Pool Cleaners for Large Pools</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Large pools place higher demands on robotic pool cleaners. This guide compares corded and cordless options specifically for larger pool sizes.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners-for-large-pools">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/polaris-vs-dolphin-robotic-pool-cleaners">Polaris vs Dolphin Robotic Pool Cleaners: Which Brand Is Better in 2026?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Compare Polaris and Dolphin robotic pool cleaners across cleaning performance, navigation, filtration, ease of use, value, and long-term ownership to decide which brand is right for your pool.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/polaris-vs-dolphin-robotic-pool-cleaners">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/best-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-large-pools">Best Robotic Pool Cleaner for Large Pools</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Large pools place higher demands on robotic pool cleaners. This guide explains what features matter most and highlights the best options for extended coverage and reliable performance.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/best-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-large-pools">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/best-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-deep-pools">Best Robotic Pool Cleaner for Deep Pools</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>Deep pools pose unique challenges for robotic cleaners due to increased depth and vertical coverage. This guide highlights the best options and what features matter most.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/best-robotic-pool-cleaner-for-deep-pools">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus vs Polaris 9650iQ Sport: Which Should You Choose?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-09</p><p>A direct comparison of two popular robotic pool cleaners: the Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus and the Polaris 9650iQ Sport. Find out which one matches your needs.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-polaris-9650iq-sport">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/robotic-pool-cleaners-for-leaves-vs-fine-debris">Robotic Pool Cleaner for Leaves vs Fine Debris: What to Look For</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-02-01</p><p>Leaves and fine debris place very different demands on robotic pool cleaners. Learn how filtration, suction, and brush design affect real-world cleaning performance.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/robotic-pool-cleaners-for-leaves-vs-fine-debris">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/do-robotic-pool-cleaners-clean-walls-and-waterlines">Do Robotic Pool Cleaners Clean Walls and Waterlines?</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-01-18</p><p>Not all robotic pool cleaners handle walls and waterlines the same way. Learn how wall climbing works, what waterline cleaning requires, and which features actually matter.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/do-robotic-pool-cleaners-clean-walls-and-waterlines">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href="/blog/why-you-need-a-robot-pool-cleaner">Why You Need a Robot Pool Cleaner: A History of Clean</a></h3><p class="text-muted">Posted on <!-- -->2026-01-11</p><p>From manual scrubbing to autonomous robots: The history of pool cleaning and why a robot is cheaper than a service.</p><a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" href="/blog/why-you-need-a-robot-pool-cleaner">Read More</a></article><article class="mb-4"><h3><a href